# Commands:
#   /eye on|off|snap|ocr|describe [prompt]
#   /bifrost on|off|status
#   /anchors list|add <name> <x> <y> <z> [meta...]|del <name>
#   /melody on|off|thrum [hz] [seconds]
#   /ancestral on|off|push <path>|status
